# WeatherGPT environment variables
#
# The application is a static frontend. It needs NO credentials and NO .env file
# to run: weather, geocoding, radar, tiles and fonts are public, key-free services
# called directly from the browser.
#
# There is deliberately no LLM backend in this version (see
# docs/ASSISTANT_DECISION.md). The names below are placeholders documenting what
# a future, separately deployed assistant backend would need. They are NOT read
# by any code in this repository today. Never put a real secret in this file or
# in frontend code; real values belong in the backend's own secret store.
#
# WEATHERGPT_ASSISTANT_BACKEND_URL=
# WEATHERGPT_LLM_API_KEY=
# WEATHERGPT_LLM_MODEL=
